                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Normally, I would recommend this. The game has a great atmosphere and interesting story to explore. Some puzzles were a bit far fetched but that usually is the case with adventure games. Sadly, they decided to add a useless launcher to a game that is now about ten years old. I could not even play the game until I contacted support who had somehow connected this game to an ancient email of mine. At least support did help out, but this is absolutely unnecessary. I feel bad for the developers to have this shoved onto them. \r\nEither way, my playthrough is here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ptn-g5yX05U&list=PLSZ0PfU8Gq_I",
